    new "我准备好了。"

    # game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:12
    old "I have something to do first."
    new "我还有点事要先做。"

    # game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:69
    old "Well, what do YOU think about it?"
    new "那么，你是怎么想的？"

    # game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:73
    old "What's the matter, you don't think divinity suits me?"
    new "怎么了，你觉得神性不适合我？"

    # game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:77
    old "I'm here to help people... I don't want people to just think I'm just another monster."
    new "我是来帮人们的……我不想让人们觉得我只是又一个怪物。"

    # game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:82
    old "Fuck 'em. Better they fear me than think they can try and tame me."
    new "去他们的。与其让他们觉得可以驯服我，不如让他们怕我。"

    # game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:94
    old "Why not? Let's go."
    new "为什么不呢？走吧。"

    # game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:96
    old "I think I should just walk you home."
    new "我觉得我还是送你回家吧。"

    # game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:522
    old "I'll learn some history another time."
    new "我改天再学历史吧。"

    # game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:524
    old "Sure, I'm interested..."
    new "当然，我很感兴趣……"

    # game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:621
    old "Oh you're very weird."
    new "哦你真是太怪了。"

    # game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:626
    old "You'd be surprised how quickly the first thing people do after seeing death is jump into bed with someone..."
    new "你会惊讶于人们看到死亡后第一件事就是跳上床和某人做爱有多快……"

    # game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:848
    old "We should just stay friends."
    new "我们还是只做朋友吧。"

    # game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:914
    old "This wasn't part of the deal... What's in it for me?"
    new "这不在交易范围内……我有什么好处？"

    # game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:918
    old "Fine."
    new "好吧。"

    # game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:920
    old "I'm not an assassin... and I'm certainly not that cheap."
    new "我不是刺客……而且我肯定没那么便宜。"

    # game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:923
    old "Just point me in the right direction."
    new "给我指个方向就行。"

    # game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:1260
    old "I need some time."
    new "我需要一些时间。"

    # game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:1334
    old "Oh good! More skins for my collection!"
    new "太好了！我的收藏又多几张皮了！"

    # game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:1351
    old "You can still walk away..."
    new "你现在走还来得及……"

    # game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:1558
    old "Your coin."
    new "你的钱。"

    # game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:1566
    old "Coin is a little tight... Would six-fifty suffice?"
    new "钱有点紧……六百五十够吗？"

    # game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:1572
    old "I will return when I have the coin."
    new "我有钱了就回来。"

    # game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:1684
    old "I'll return when I have the coin."
    new "我有钱了就回来。"

    # game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:2085
    old "A kiss."
    new "一个吻。"

